Package: preventive-shield
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), xdg-utils
Maintainer: busdo <shield@localhost>
Description: busdo desktop — Cybersecurity Service Tool (browser shell)
 Local dashboard and HTTP proxy. Opens the system browser via xdg-open.
 Does not enable autostart on install; open-at-login stays off until the user
 turns it on in the dashboard. CI packages against Node 22; postinst warns if
 the installed nodejs major differs.
Homepage: https://pcpd.mtsu.workers.dev
